{"reviews":[{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-0","r":3.0,"t":"Looking for a glass bottle.","x":"I did a lot of studying before I bought this bottle. It is advertised as an acetone bottle which is what I wanted it for but all of the plastic acetone bottles start to bulge and will eventually eat thru the plastic. What i am going to use it for is alcohol, and keep looking out for a glass container that will hold the acetone and not eat thru it.","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-1","r":5.0,"t":"EXTREMELY functional","x":"I'm diabetic and have neuropathy in my hands on top of arthritis, so fussing with opening and handling those little packets of alcohol pads is a problem. A nice fat cotton ball and this dispenser was the perfect answer for me. I'm quite prone to knocking things about, as well, so the fact that it's spill proof with the cap on and even spill reducing without the cap is a big plus.  I highly recommend this product!","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-2","r":5.0,"t":"Doesn't leak! Whew!","x":"I filled mine with polish remover.  It works as expected, dispenses remover efficiently.  Plus, Purple!! The best thing (besides Purple!) is that it doesn't leak.  I inadvertently knocked it over on my carpet and didn't realize it for several hours.  When I saw the dispenser laying on its side, I just knew my carpet was ruined.  Amazingly, not a drop spilled!  Of all the polish dispensers I've tried in the past, this is the first one that hasn't leaked. I'd buy it again and recommend it to frien","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-3","r":5.0,"t":"This is my second one","x":"Repeat buyer! I use it at work for dog ear cleaner. It does what it\u2019s supposed to do. Sometimes you need to trim then very end of the tube because it\u2019s too long and you can\u2019t get much product when you push down :)","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-4","r":2.0,"t":"Disappointed","x":"Sturdy, pump works well, and attractive. BUT with first use a drip of acetone down the side etched the finish.  It will be quite ugly very quickly. May be good for alcohol or something not acetone.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-5","r":3.0,"t":"Otherwise its good.","x":"the acetone actually eats the bottle and leaves white marks and such, which is weird since it's an acetone bottle. Otherwise its good. lol","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-6","r":1.0,"t":"Leaks -_-","x":"Leaks -_- Basically this bottle had one job. It failed. It ruined my makeup bag. Avoid this product.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-7","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Works great for wife and kids doing nails. Good pump and don't leak","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-8","r":5.0,"t":"Perfoect for my uses.","x":"I use this with a cotton round for cleaning my beauty spatulas. It fits in my cabinet behind my mirror with it's lid open (turned sideways) and makes the entire process much more efficient because I don't have to pick it up and open it to use it. It arrived in good condition and feels like it will last.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-9","r":4.0,"t":"Great Product !","x":"Very happy with this bottle! Works just as I need it to for holding Isopropyl Alcohol to clean my makeup brushes. The only downside is that it can be a little tough to push to release the Alcohol. I can't just use the brush I have to pump it with my hand. Still totally worth it!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-10","r":5.0,"t":"Works perfectly for alcohol.","x":"The push top bottle that I've had which I use for alcohol grew legs and took off so I needed a new one. Imagine my surprise to find one punk colored! It works as good as my clear one. I just love \u2764\ufe0f  it and will probably order a couplr more for spares.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-11","r":5.0,"t":"Economical and ecological DIY alcohol cleaning pads","x":"Works great!  Just what I needed very economical and produces much less waste than individually wrapped alcohol pads.  I buy a package of square cosmetic pads and cut them up into quarters to use with this dispenser.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-12","r":5.0,"t":"They do not leak","x":"These bottles pump well and with ease.  I bought several for gifts. Personally, I use for astringent but have seen manicurist use for polish removal.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-13","r":5.0,"t":"Works as expected; sturdy plastic!","x":"Make sure you keep the material you\u2019re saturating over the depressor when it comes back up or you\u2019ll have it spray product all over the place! \ud83d\ude42","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-14","r":5.0,"t":"After using bottled alcohol for my diabetic supplies, this ...","x":"After using bottled alcohol for my diabetic supplies, this saves on the wasted/excess alcohol used in my past.  Thank you!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-15","r":4.0,"t":"Oops","x":"To my nail techs out there be careful when putting acetone in this lol but still going to use it tho \ud83d\ude05","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-16","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"It's just what I was looking for as I use it for fiber optical cleaning","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-17","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Perfect before my insulin shot and it matches my bathroom.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-18","r":5.0,"t":"So much better than wetting wipes from a bottle.","x":"It works like a charm and does not leak in a suitcase.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-19","r":5.0,"t":"No Leak Design!","x":"I am very pleased with the size of this container as well as the function.  I utilize it for my eyelash extension cleanser, and it works beautifully.  There is no leakage, or getting stuck when pressing on it to get the solution out.  I will definitely recommend these for anyone in the beauty world for their cleansers, solutions or removers as it is a convenient life safer!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-20","r":3.0,"t":"Works but pumps way too much for nail polish remover use","x":"Everything\u2019s works fine. Except that for nail polish remover (accent one) use. The wipe is SOAKED and I feel like I\u2019m using too much. If I do a half pump, sometimes the liquid goes to the wrong way. Wouldn\u2019t repurchase personally but other wise, fine if you want to pump liquids for other use.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-21","r":4.0,"t":"Used it for another use but it works great...","x":"I stored apple cider vinegar in this because I use it 3 or 4 times a week with a cotton ball on my face.  ACV is great for fading age spots as well as being a great toner.  Bottle is a nice weight plastic and the push top works without a hitch...","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-22","r":5.0,"t":"Convenient pump bottle","x":"I do a lot of crafting and I use alcohol to clean my projects before I apply vinyl.  It is so convenient and makes it so much easier using the push down pump, rather than getting a cotton pad & the alcohol.  Perfect for what I needed.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-23","r":5.0,"t":"Works as expected.","x":"Works as expected. I was hoping to find a glass bottom and metal top with an easy flip cap to leave on the counter. This isn\u2019t that but I thought I\u2019d give it a try. It\u2019s all plastic and the cap seals. So maybe it travels well.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B07HYP9VK6-24","r":5.0,"t":"great buy at a great price","x":"I like this product and its a great buy for the money. I bought it to use for my liquid monomer to use with acrylics. Its a great bottle. The pump springs up nicely which you need when using liquids. I recommend this.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the pump dispenser works well and is easy to use for alcohol, polish remover, and similar liquids.","cites":[2,3,8,11,13,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers report that the bottle does not leak, even when knocked over.","cites":[3,8,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers report that acetone damages the bottle, causing white marks or etching the finish, despite it being advertised for acetone.","cites":[1,5,6]},{"text":"A few reviewers complain that the bottle leaks and ruined their belongings.","cites":[7]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the pump can be tough to push or requires trimming the tube to get product out.","cites":[4,10]}]},"qa":[]}